# generator-assets — local configuration (audit §2.3)
#
# Copy this file as ".env" at the repo root (never versioned) and
# uncomment the lines to override. No variable is mandatory:
# without a .env, the defaults of core/config.py apply (reference Windows
# workstation: engines under C:\, models under C:\Modeles_LLM).
#
# Priority: shell environment variable > .env > core/config.py default.
# Format: KEY=VALUE (one per line), # comments, quotes optional.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- engines
# Paths of the C++ Vulkan executables (defaults: C:\llama.cpp, C:\SD,
# C:\audio-cpp, ffmpeg resolved automatically C:\ffmpeg\dist\bin).
# LLAMA_CLI_PATH=C:\llama.cpp\llama-cli.exe
# SD_CLI_PATH=C:\SD\sd-cli.exe
# AUDIOCPP_PATH=C:\audio-cpp\audiocpp_cli.exe
# FFMPEG_PATH=C:\ffmpeg\dist\bin\ffmpeg.exe

# Parallel sd-cli master-841 build (LTX/MiniMax-H3 workaround until the
# upstream regression is fixed — cf. SKILL.md §pitfalls):
# SD_CLI_PATH=C:\SD-6b3edaa\sd-cli.exe

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- models
# Root folder of the GGUF/safetensors models (default: C:\Modeles_LLM).
# MODEL_DIR=C:\Modeles_LLM
# Per-model overrides (defaults derived from MODEL_DIR):
# SD_MODEL_PATH=C:\Modeles_LLM\flux1-dev-Q6_K.gguf
# WAN_MODEL_PATH=C:\Modeles_LLM\wan2.1-t2v-1.3b-q8_0.gguf
# KOKORO_TTS_MODEL=C:\Modeles_LLM\Kokoro-82M-GGUF\kokoro-82m-q8_0.gguf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- outputs
# Output folder of the generations (default: output/, ignored by git;
# godot_assets/ = validated reference assets only).
# OUTPUT_DIR=output
